{"v":[{"a":["تَبَّتۡ","يَدَآ","أَبِي","لَهَبٖ","وَتَبَّ"],"t":"Condemned are the hands of Abee Lahab, and he is condemned","l":"Tabbat Yada 'Abi Lahabin Wa Tabba","w":[["tabbat","Perish"],["yadā","(the) hands"],["abī","(of) Abu"],["lahabin","Lahab"],["watabba","and perish he"]]},{"a":["مَآ","أَغۡنَىٰ","عَنۡهُ","مَالُهُۥ","وَمَا","كَسَبَ"],"t":"His wealth did not avail him, nor did what he acquired","l":"Ma 'Aghna `Anhu Maluhu Wa Ma Kasaba","w":[["mā","Not"],["aghnā","(will) avail"],["ʿanhu","him"],["māluhu","his wealth"],["wamā","and what"],["kasaba","he earned"]]},{"a":["سَيَصۡلَىٰ","نَارٗا","ذَاتَ","لَهَبٖ"],"t":"He will burn in a Flaming Fire","l":"Sayasla Naraan Dhata Lahabin","w":[["sayaṣlā","He will be burnt"],["nāran","(in) a Fire"],["dhāta","of"],["lahabin","Blazing Flames"]]},{"a":["وَٱمۡرَأَتُهُۥ","حَمَّالَةَ","ٱلۡحَطَبِ"],"t":"And his wife—the firewood carrier","l":"Wa Amra'atuhu Hammalata Al-Hatabi","w":[["wa-im'ra-atuhu","And his wife"],["ḥammālata","(the) carrier"],["l-ḥaṭabi","(of) firewood"]]},{"a":["فِي","جِيدِهَا","حَبۡلٞ","مِّن","مَّسَدِۭ"],"t":"Around her neck is a rope of thorns","l":"Fi Jidiha Hablun Min Masadin","w":[["fī","In"],["jīdihā","her neck"],["ḥablun","(will be) a rope"],["min","of"],["masadin","palm-fiber"]]}]}